Overview of Workflow : 
When a new email arrives in the raw-inbox Gmail label, the Zap is triggered and triggers  Apps Script through a webhook. The Apps Script analyzes the email and determines whether it is a genuine customer support issue. Based on the result, the email is categorized and processed then goes to new-ticket label.

